# game/week5.rpy:8
translate indonesian week5_start_d9ad60a8:

    # n "The morning sun feels nice and gentle as it shines through the trees on the street."
    n  "Sinar matahari pagi terasa hangat dan lembut menyelinap di sela-sela pepohonan di sepanjang jalan."

# game/week5.rpy:9
translate indonesian week5_start_64e62f3a:

    # n "It is Sunday, when you do not hear the sound of engines but instead you hear a lot of voices, the sound of bicycles, and the smell of street food."
    n  "Hari ini hari Minggu, hari di mana deru bising mesin kendaraan sirna, berganti keriuhan tawa canda, gemerincing sepeda, dan semerbak aroma jajanan kaki lima."

# game/week5.rpy:10
translate indonesian week5_start_4105aa12:

    # n "As you walk up the CFD, all the sounds and smells are too much for your senses to even keep up."
    n  "Saat kamu melangkah menelusuri CFD, seluruh aroma dan suara yang berpadu seakan meluap memenuhi seluruh inderamu."

# game/week5.rpy:11
translate indonesian week5_start_a1beccb3:

    # n "The street is filled with shops in tents selling all kinds of specialties and other things."
    n  "Bahu jalan dipadati deretan tenda penjual yang menjajakan aneka kuliner khas dan berbagai pernak-pernik."

# game/week5.rpy:12
translate indonesian week5_start_9641fdae:

    # n "The smell of soto ayam is really good, with the smell of fresh juice and the smell of satay barbecue colliding like a music sheet."
    n  "Aroma sedap kuah soto ayam berpadu harmonis dengan segarnya jus buah dan harumnya sate yang dibakar di atas arang, bagai alunan partitur nada."

# game/week5.rpy:13
translate indonesian week5_start_3ca9763e:

    # n "This is the weekend in weeks that you believe will be the greatest weekend ever."
    n  "Ini adalah akhir pekan pertama setelah berminggu-minggu yang kamu yakini akan menjadi akhir pekan terbaik."

# game/week5.rpy:15
translate indonesian week5_start_388a2b47:

    # n "You walk through the crowd trying to go with the flow."
    n  "Kamu berjalan santai di tengah kerumunan, membiarkan langkah kakimu larut dalam arus suasana."

# game/week5.rpy:16
translate indonesian week5_start_528887d2:

    # n "You stop sometimes to look at the strange shops, watch the kids flying their balloons, and finally get caught waiting in line for iced coffee."
    n  "Sesekali kamu berhenti memandangi lapak-lapak unik, memperhatikan anak-anak kecil yang riang memegang balon, hingga akhirnya ikut mengantre segelas es kopi."

# game/week5.rpy:17
translate indonesian week5_start_8efe5d2e:

    # p "Everything feels... peaceful."
    p  "Semuanya terasa... begitu damai."

# game/week5.rpy:19
translate indonesian week5_start_3cb97c49:

    # n "As you stand holding your drink in your palms, you scan the horizon of people from families and students milling about."
    n  "Sembari menggenggam minuman dingin di tanganmu, kamu mengedarkan pandangan ke lautan manusia—dari rombongan keluarga hingga gerombolan pelajar yang berlalu-lalang."

# game/week5.rpy:20
translate indonesian week5_start_da16dd49:

    # n "Then you catch a glimpse of someone familiar standing near a clothing stall."
    n  "Lalu, matamu menangkap sosok yang tak asing berdiri di dekat sebuah stan pakaian."

# game/week5.rpy:21
translate indonesian week5_start_b54d0931:

    # n "With your courage and curiosity peeking a sense to approach, you take a step there before finally spotting Trida, who was seen leaning against a rack of shirts, looking more at ease than you've seen them all week."
    n  "Didorong rasa penasaran dan keberanian untuk menyapa, kamu melangkah mendekat hingga mendapati Trida yang tengah bersandar di gantungan baju, tampak jauh lebih rileks dibanding hari-hari biasanya di sekolah."

# game/week5.rpy:25
translate indonesian week5_start_d3d0940e:

    # cap_boy "...I'm telling you, I spent three hours just trying to get the bridge tool to cooperate in Blender. My mesh looked like a crumpled piece of paper by the time I was done."
    cap_boy  "...Beneran deh, aku ngabisin tiga jam cuma buat bikin tool bridge di Blender mau nurut. Pas kelar, jaring-jaring mesh punyaku malah remuk kayak kertas lecek."

# game/week5.rpy:26
translate indonesian week5_start_1a27ef20:

    # braided_girl "That's because you're probably just extruding faces without thinking about your topology, dude."
    braided_girl  "Itu mah kamunya aja yang asal ekstrusi face tanpa mikirin topologi yang bener, Bro."

# game/week5.rpy:28
translate indonesian week5_start_acf263b7:

    # n "As Trida's gaze lands on you before anyone else, a smile tugging on their face brings a sudden contrast of warmth jolted from your stomach."
    n  "Saat pandangan Trida tertuju padamu sebelum teman-temannya menyadari, seulas senyum terkembang di wajahnya, menghantarkan sengatan rasa hangat yang tiba-tiba berdesir di perutmu."

# game/week5.rpy:29
translate indonesian week5_start_2007e709:

    # n "Their eyes light up with a spark igniting the room before their mouth is running around again."
    n  "Matanya berbinar cerah bagai percikan api yang menyalakan ruangan, sebelum mulutnya kembali berceloteh riang."

# game/week5.rpy:33
translate indonesian week5_start_52977c49:

    # trida "Oh, hey! Look who it is!"
    trida  "Eh, halo! Coba lihat siapa yang datang!"

# game/week5.rpy:35
translate indonesian week5_start_9c7885c3:

    # n "The two friends glance at each other before they turn to see what's happening."
    n  "Kedua temannya saling pandang sejenak sebelum menoleh untuk melihat apa yang sedang terjadi."

# game/week5.rpy:36
translate indonesian week5_start_3b2f61ee:

    # cap_boy "Is this the person I remember always near you at the lab all day, Trida?"
    cap_boy  "Ini anak yang sering kulihat nongkrong bareng kamu seharian di lab itu kan, Trida?"

# game/week5.rpy:37
translate indonesian week5_start_bf27cc0f:

    # braided_girl "Quit it, you're being a weirdo. Sorry about him—he's just a bit... much."
    braided_girl  "Udah deh, jangan bikin orang risih. Maafin dia ya—dia emang rada... aneh anaknya."

# game/week5.rpy:38
translate indonesian week5_start_9e8e724f:

    # cap_boy "I'm not a weirdo, I'm observant. There's a difference, thank you very much."
    cap_boy  "Aku nggak aneh ya, aku ini cuma jeli mengamati sekitar. Beda jauh tahu, makasih banyak!"

# game/week5.rpy:39
translate indonesian week5_start_50ed0ff4:

    # braided_girl "Whatever he says."
    braided_girl  "Terserah apa katamu deh."

# game/week5.rpy:40
translate indonesian week5_start_78331513:

    # n "She rolls her eyes, as her attention is caught back at you with a defining smile."
    n  "Gadis itu memutar bola matanya malas, lalu kembali memusatkan perhatiannya padamu dengan senyuman ramah."

# game/week5.rpy:41
translate indonesian week5_start_cfe50d4d:

    # braided_girl "Anyway, back to the point—you're in our class, right?"
    braided_girl  "Ngomong-ngomong, kamu sekelas sama kita kan ya?"

# game/week5.rpy:45
translate indonesian week5_start_fb6ebddb:

    # p "Yeah, I am."
    p  "Iya, bener."

# game/week5.rpy:47
translate indonesian week5_start_f6468db8:

    # p "No, I am not."
    p  "Nggak, bukan."

# game/week5.rpy:49
translate indonesian week5_start_a42fe20d:

    # n "You keep silent, watching the dynamic unfold."
    n  "Kamu memilih tetap diam, memperhatikan dinamika obrolan mereka berdua."

# game/week5.rpy:51
translate indonesian week5_start_e1f3a270:

    # trida "Guys, please... calm down. I know we only knew each other for a couple of months, but you two should try to remember names from now on!"
    trida  "Kalian berdua tolong... tenang sedikit napa. Aku tahu kita baru kenal beberapa bulan, tapi mulai sekarang kalian harus coba ingat-ingat nama teman dong!"

# game/week5.rpy:52
translate indonesian week5_start_0b7664d0:

    # trida "This is [player_name], and yes, they are in our class."
    trida  "Ini [player_name], dan iya, dia sekelas sama kita."

# game/week5.rpy:53
translate indonesian week5_start_7340f852:

    # p "Glad to see you."
    p  "Senang bertemu dengan kalian."

# game/week5.rpy:55
translate indonesian week5_start_a9ac0f10:

    # n "The atmosphere shifts instantly as The Cap Boy stops teasing, and the Braided Girl's expression changes immediately."
    n  "Suasana langsung mencair; si cowok bertopi berhenti meledek, dan raut wajah si cewek berkepang seketika berubah bersahabat."

# game/week5.rpy:56
translate indonesian week5_start_74cb7d36:

    # cap_boy "Ah, my bad! Didn't mean to be rude. It's just rare for me to catch names and faces, you know?"
    cap_boy  "Ah, salahku deh! Nggak ada niat buat nggak sopan kok. Maklum lah, aku emang susah nginget nama sama muka orang, hehe."

# game/week5.rpy:57
translate indonesian week5_start_40843e2b:

    # braided_girl "Yeah, there are so many people in RUS. It's good to meet you here, [player_name]."
    braided_girl  "Iya, anak-anak di RUS kan banyak banget. Senang bisa ketemu kamu di sini, [player_name]."

# game/week5.rpy:59
translate indonesian week5_start_4a5231b4:

    # n "You exchange a few light pleasantries about the bustling weekend crowds and the morning's oppressive humidity."
    n  "Kalian saling bertukar sapaan ringan seputar ramainya akhir pekan dan hawa gerah khas pagi hari."

# game/week5.rpy:60
translate indonesian week5_start_b55aa300:

    # n "For a brief moment, the four of you soak in the vibrant energy of the CFD, surrounded by the sounds of distant chatter and clattering equipment."
    n  "Untuk beberapa saat, kalian berempat larut menikmati riuhnya energi CFD, ditemani suara obrolan yang riuh dan denting peralatan masak di kejauhan."

# game/week5.rpy:61
translate indonesian week5_start_09c42648:

    # n "Just as you start to savor the atmosphere, the boy in a cap glances at their watch with wide eyes."
    n  "Tepat saat kamu mulai menikmati suasana, cowok bertopi itu mendadak menatap jam tangannya dengan mata membelalak lebar."

# game/week5.rpy:63
translate indonesian week5_start_aa71e1fd:

    # cap_boy "How does time fly? Some food is calling my name, and I have to hurry before the stocks run out!"
    cap_boy  "Gila, waktu cepet banget lewat! Aroma makanan udah manggil-manggil namaku nih, harus buru-buru sebelum kehabisan!"

# game/week5.rpy:64
translate indonesian week5_start_b83ee7d2:

    # braided_girl "Oh, same. I think we still have plenty of ground to cover today anyway."
    braided_girl  "Oh, iya juga. Lagian tujuan kita jalan-jalan hari ini masih banyak kan."

# game/week5.rpy:65
translate indonesian week5_start_1f288945:

    # n "The girl grins before glancing forth and back to Trida and you."
    n  "Gadis itu tersenyum simpul sebelum melirik bergantian ke arahmu dan Trida."

# game/week5.rpy:66
translate indonesian week5_start_6871f852:

    # n "You know she looks like she is picking up a hint the entire convo, before she subtly nudges the boy, who stares at her with a nod in response."
    n  "Dari tatapannya, ia jelas-jelas menangkap sinyal tertentu sedari tadi, sebelum ia menyenggol pelan lengan si cowok, yang langsung dibalas dengan anggukan paham."

# game/week5.rpy:68
translate indonesian week5_start_d3715edd:

    # cap_boy "Right! Totally. Catch you later, Trida! Don't spend too much on useless things!"
    cap_boy  "Oke deh! Cabut dulu ya, Trida! Jangan kalap borong barang-barang nggak guna!"

# game/week5.rpy:73
translate indonesian week5_start_452b25d3:

    # n "The two friends share a knowing smirk before disappearing into the vibrant crowd."
    n  "Kedua teman itu saling bertukar senyum penuh arti sebelum akhirnya menghilang ditelan keramaian orang."

# game/week5.rpy:74
translate indonesian week5_start_d08b1d6b:

    # n "With their departure, a refreshing stillness envelops you and Trida."
    n  "Seiring kepergian mereka berdua, keheningan yang menyejukkan mendadak menyelimuti kamu dan Trida."

# game/week5.rpy:75
translate indonesian week5_start_1127d837:

    # n "Trida lets out a long, exaggerated sigh of confusion and tiredness, watching both of their friends."
    n  "Trida menghembuskan napas panjang yang terdengar heran sekaligus lelah, memperhatikan langkah kedua temannya yang menjauh."

# game/week5.rpy:77
translate indonesian week5_start_f8897283:

    # trida "What's gotten into them leaving us suddenly like that?"
    trida  "Kesambet apa sih mereka mendadak kabur ninggalin kita begitu aja?"

# game/week5.rpy:78
translate indonesian week5_start_f196e9a3:

    # trida "But they really are good people, so don't worry about that."
    trida  "Tapi mereka aslinya orang baik kok, jadi nggak usah dipikirin ya."

# game/week5.rpy:79
translate indonesian week5_start_33b4fb29:

    # n "They turn their attention fully to you, as you see their expression softening."
    n  "Ia mengalihkan perhatiannya seutuhnya padamu, dan kamu bisa melihat raut wajahnya melembut perlahan."

# game/week5.rpy:80
translate indonesian week5_start_17e0ce14:

    # trida "Also, didn't expect to run into you here..."
    trida  "Nggak nyangka juga bakal papasan sama kamu di sini..."

# game/week5.rpy:81
translate indonesian week5_start_e7765747:

    # trida "I thought you were the type to stay in and recharge alone on Sundays. How's your CFD been so far?"
    trida  "Kukira kamu tipe orang yang lebih milih rebahan di kamar buat ngecas energi tiap hari Minggu. Gimana CFD-mu sejauh ini?"

# game/week5.rpy:82
translate indonesian week5_start_d8b7215e:

    # p "It's been nice, that's for sure."
    p  "Asyik banget kok, santai rasanya."

# game/week5.rpy:83
translate indonesian week5_start_0f9917b3:

    # trida "God, I feel that. My brain feels like it's actually defragging for once."
    trida  "Duh, beneran deh, relate banget. Rasanya otakku akhirnya bisa sedikit didefrag setelah sekian lama."

# game/week5.rpy:85
translate indonesian week5_start_e8a6d4a9:

    # n "They pause, glancing at the long, winding path of the CFD stretch ahead, filled with colorful tents and the scent of grilled food."
    n  "Trida terdiam sesaat, memandangi jalur panjang CFD yang berkelok-kelok di depan, dihiasi tenda-tenda warna-warni dan harum makanan yang dipanggang."

# game/week5.rpy:86
translate indonesian week5_start_2d501d29:

    # n "They hesitate, their fingers nervously tracing the edge of their sketchpad."
    n  "Ia tampak ragu, jemarinya mengetuk-ngetuk cemas pinggiran buku sketsa yang dibawanya."

# game/week5.rpy:87
translate indonesian week5_start_d917d76e:

    # trida "Actually... I was just going to wander a bit more. Any interest in walking together?"
    trida  "Sebenarnya... aku masih pengin keliling-keliling lagi sih. Kamu mau jalan bareng nggak?"

# game/week5.rpy:100
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_1d748fc7:

    # p "Sure, I'd love to. It's nice to have some company."
    p  "Boleh, ayo. Asyik juga jalan ada temannya."

# game/week5.rpy:102
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_939996b6:

    # n "Trida's face lights up—not just a smile, but a look of genuine, unfiltered relief."
    n  "Wajah Trida seketika berseri-seri—bukan cuma sekadar senyuman biasa, tapi pancaran rasa lega yang tulus dan jujur."

# game/week5.rpy:103
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_1c8fffc3:

    # n "They quickly tuck their phone into their pocket and adjust their bag."
    n  "Ia bergegas memasukkan ponselnya ke dalam saku dan membetulkan posisi tali tasnya."

# game/week5.rpy:104
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_98ed6482:

    # trida "Really? I was worried that I would bother you."
    trida  "Beneran nih? Tadinya sempat kepikiran kalau aku bakal ngeganggu waktumu."

# game/week5.rpy:105
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_91215fa1:

    # trida "Alright then, I promise I'll be your great tour guide around here!"
    trida  "Kalau gitu, kujamin deh aku bakal jadi pemandu wisata terbaikmu di sini!"

# game/week5.rpy:106
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_765d675e:

    # p "Oh, what a pleasure..."
    p  "Wah, sebuah kehormatan dong..."

# game/week5.rpy:109
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_87647a02:

    # n "The humidity of Kudus' air is hitting hard."
    n  "Hawa lembap dan terik udara Kudus mulai terasa menyengat."

# game/week5.rpy:110
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_1b455cfe:

    # n "You and Trida have been drifting through the people walking like a sea of ants with the noise that can't be filtered."
    n  "Kamu dan Trida terus melangkah di antara lautan orang yang bergerak laksana gerombolan semut, diiringi keriuhan suara yang tak henti-hentinya bersahutan."

# game/week5.rpy:111
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_7ca2fd8e:

    # n "They move with their hands, sharing a bag of cireng to you and dodging people like traffic alongside."
    n  "Kedua tangannya aktif bergerak, membagikan sekantong cireng hangat kepadamu sambil dengan lincah berkelit menghindari orang-orang yang berpapasan."

# game/week5.rpy:112
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_44263ca4:

    # trida "Honestly, this was actually more fun than spending time with you in the Lab, like we're actually on hangout!"
    trida  "Jujur ya, ini jauh lebih seru daripada nongkrong di lab bareng kamu, berasa lagi jalan-jalan beneran!"

# game/week5.rpy:113
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_86cc82a6:

    # p "It's a Sunday thing. We are trying to clear our heads."
    p  "Namanya juga hari Minggu. Kita butuh refreshing buat menenangkan pikiran."

# game/week5.rpy:114
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_872a1270:

    # trida "Clear our head, huh? That was a good thing to do besides sitting in front of the monitor and muttering I guess..."
    trida  "Menenangkan pikiran ya... Pilihan yang bijak sih ketimbang cuma bengong komat-kamit di depan monitor seharian, hehe..."

# game/week5.rpy:116
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_bd94f315:

    # n "As they walk backwards, laughter spilling from their lips, they misjudge the curb and suddenly lose their footing."
    n  "Sambil berjalan mundur dengan tawa riang yang mengalir dari bibirnya, ia salah memperhitungkan trotoar dan mendadak kehilangan keseimbangan."

# game/week5.rpy:117
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_21d0da9c:

    # n "With a surprised expression, they crash to the ground, the impact silencing their laughter as they skid across the pavement, arms flailing before coming to a halt in a tangled heap."
    n  "Dengan ekspresi kaget yang terpampang di wajahnya, ia jatuh terjerembap ke tanah. Tawanya seketika lenyap saat tubuhnya meluncur di atas aspal dengan tangan terayun panik sebelum akhirnya berhenti berguling kikuk."

# game/week5.rpy:118
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_2460d9f5:

    # trida "OUCH!"
    trida  "AWWW!"

# game/week5.rpy:120
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_b4f00481:

    # p "Whoa! Are you okay?"
    p  "Waduh! Kamu nggak apa-apa?!"

# game/week5.rpy:121
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_a3c13665:

    # n "You grab their arm, hauling them up before they hit the concrete hard."
    n  "Kamu sigap mencengkeram lengannya, membantunya bangkit sebelum tubuhnya menghantam kerasnya aspal."

# game/week5.rpy:123
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_4d0271c6:

    # n "As they stand up with a face turning bright red like a boiled tomato, frantically brushing dust off their jeans."
    n  "Ia berdiri tegak dengan wajah yang memerah padam laksana tomat rebus, terburu-buru menepuk-nepuk debu yang menempel di celana jinsnya."

# game/week5.rpy:124
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_e040a6cf:

    # trida "I—I meant to do that! It was, uh... testing the ground friction. Super important for, uh, principles of animation, right?"
    trida  "A—aku sengaja kok begitu tadi! Itu... lagi ngetes gaya gesek lantai doang. Penting banget tahu buat, um, prinsip dasar animasi, ya kan?!"

# game/week5.rpy:125
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_34008323:

    # p "You're a total disaster."
    p  "Kamu bener-bener kacau deh ah."

# game/week5.rpy:128
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_5e283bc2:

    # n "Trida chuckled, although their cheeks remained bright red."
    n  "Trida tertawa canggung, meski kedua pipinya masih merona merah terang."

# game/week5.rpy:129
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_04bd0ef4:

    # trida "Shut up! My legs are just tired, okay? Just... don't tell the others!"
    trida  "Berisik ah! Kakiku emang lagi lemas aja, paham? Pokoknya... awas ya kalau sampai bocor ke anak-anak lain!"

# game/week5.rpy:131
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_200b55ce:

    # n "As the laughter faded, both of you eventually found a bench far away from the hustle and bustle."
    n  "Saat tawa mereka perlahan mereda, kalian berdua akhirnya menemukan sebuah bangku taman yang jauh dari hiruk-pikuk keramaian."

# game/week5.rpy:133
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_1b64db5c:

    # n "Trida dropped their body onto the seat and slumped there looking as if they had just returned from war."
    n  "Trida menghempaskan tubuhnya ke bangku itu dan bersandar lunglai, tampak seperti prajurit yang baru saja pulang dari medan perang."

# game/week5.rpy:134
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_ad2b0a1a:

    # trida "Sorry for the drop in energy. I think I'm just... super fried, you know?"
    trida  "Maaf ya energiku mendadak anjlok gini. Rasanya badanku bener-bener... remuk banget, tahu nggak?"

# game/week5.rpy:135
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_dbea04a5:

    # p "Yeah, this event is really crowded. No wonder you felt like that."
    p  "Wajar kok, acaranya rame banget padatnya. Nggak heran kalau kamu capek."

# game/week5.rpy:136
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_8a311eb4:

    # trida "Totally. It's making my mind feel overstimulated."
    trida  "Asli deh. Suasananya bikin kepalaku rasanya overstimulasi banget."

# game/week5.rpy:138
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_1d841772:

    # n "They paused as their gaze drifted long into the people in that town square, who looked like they never stopped coming in."
    n  "Ia terdiam sejenak, tatapannya menerawang jauh menatap lautan orang di alun-alun yang seolah tak pernah ada habisnya berdatangan."

# game/week5.rpy:139
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_43705a14:

    # trida "Maybe, what I'm about to say kind of came out of nowhere, but..."
    trida  "Mungkin apa yang mau kuomongin ini kedengarannya random banget, tapi..."

# game/week5.rpy:140
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_294e1c2d:

    # trida "This feeling makes me remember the time I tried to join 3D Animation for the first time."
    trida  "Perasaan capek ini bikin aku ingat pas pertama kali nekat milih jurusan Animasi 3D."

# game/week5.rpy:141
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_0270a861:

    # p "I thought you were confident in there?"
    p  "Kukira dari awal kamu udah pede banget di jurusan itu?"

# game/week5.rpy:142
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_fc2cd029:

    # trida "No, I am not. If I look more into it, it feels—it's overwhelming. It makes me wonder if I even wanted to do it at all at the first time."
    trida  "Nggak sama sekali. Makin kudalami, rasanya makin... bikin kewalahan. Sampai kadang aku mikir, apa bener ini hal yang memang kumau sedari awal."

# game/week5.rpy:144
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_58d35bab:

    # n "They glanced up, catching your eye. Then you saw that smile that was flooded with exhaustion and a subtle confession of tiredness."
    n  "Ia mendongak, menatap langsung ke matamu. Di sana terlihat senyuman tipis yang dibayangi rasa lelah dan pengakuan lirih akan kepenatan batinnya."

# game/week5.rpy:145
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_821eb83c:

    # trida "So staying in my room with those thoughts alone is making me scared sometimes for the failure of my future."
    trida  "Makanya kalau sendirian di kamar mikirin hal-hal kayak gitu, aku kadang takut banget bakal gagal menghadapi masa depanku nanti."

# game/week5.rpy:146
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_04cd8926:

    # trida "When we're here, outside of that lab. I don't feel like I'm going to fail, honestly. For a moment, it feels like I'm lifted a bit."
    trida  "Tapi pas kita ada di sini, di luar ruangan lab itu... anehnya rasa takut gagal itu nggak muncul sama sekali. Untuk sesaat, rasanya bebanku kayak terangkat sedikit."

# game/week5.rpy:147
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_4f387924:

    # n "Before they paused, their orange gaze softening as looking at you deeply."
    n  "Ia terdiam sejenak, tatapan oranyenya yang teduh melembut saat menatapmu lekat-lekat."

# game/week5.rpy:148
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_trida_40c7e5ec:

    # trida "Thank you for that."
    trida  "Makasih banyak ya buat hari ini."

# game/week5.rpy:156
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_d59e4a93:

    # p "I think I'll pass for now. I'm actually craving a bit more me-time before the week starts."
    p  "Kayaknya aku skip dulu deh kali ini. Lagi pengin nikmatin waktu sendiri sebelum minggu baru dimulai."

# game/week5.rpy:158
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_79eb7e19:

    # n "Trida blinks, a flicker of disappointment crossing their face before they quickly mask it with a supportive nod."
    n  "Trida mengerjap, secuil raut kecewa sempat melintas di wajahnya sebelum ia dengan cepat menutupinya lewat anggukan maklum."

# game/week5.rpy:159
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_9da99103:

    # trida "No, yeah, I totally get that. These days, it is a pressure cooker—you definitely earned some space."
    trida  "Iya, nggak apa-apa, aku ngerti banget kok. Akhir-akhir ini tugas emang lagi gila-gilaan—kamu pastinya butuh ruang buat istirahat."

# game/week5.rpy:160
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_f9bd7857:

    # n "Trida takes a half-step back, slowly giving you a slightly lopsided grin that feels awkward."
    n  "Trida mengambil setengah langkah mundur, perlahan menyunggingkan senyum miring yang terkesan canggung."

# game/week5.rpy:161
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_a09ee72f:

    # trida "Well, if not, what about I bought you dinner tonight? My treat."
    trida  "Tapi kalau nanti malam, gimana kalau aku traktir makan malam? Anggap aja traktiran dariku."

# game/week5.rpy:162
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_d09c9dac:

    # p "It would be fun."
    p  "Kedengarannya seru juga tuh."

# game/week5.rpy:163
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_a3f532d3:

    # trida "It is! It was a food restaurant near school called Bazinga. You would love it. I'll text you later..."
    trida  "Pasti seru dong! Ada warung makan deket sekolah namanya Bazinga. Kamu pasti suka. Nanti kukabari lewat chat ya..."

# game/week5.rpy:164
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_10995250:

    # p "Yeah, see you, Trida."
    p  "Sip, sampai nanti, Trida."

# game/week5.rpy:166
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_e16a44f4:

    # n "Trida gives an awkward final wave as their figure disappears into the bustling morning crowd."
    n  "Trida melambaikan tangan terakhirnya dengan kikuk sebelum sosoknya perlahan menghilang di balik kerumunan pagi."

# game/week5.rpy:168
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_047fe394:

    # n "You get a snack, you get some cimol, and find a quiet place to watch the city."
    n  "Kamu membeli beberapa camilan, seporsi cimol hangat, lalu mencari tempat duduk yang tenang untuk memandangi hiruk-pikuk kota."

# game/week5.rpy:169
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_781f7a47:

    # n "When the afternoon light starts to look like gold, your eyes catch a figure of your senior Sabian bargaining with a vendor cart."
    n  "Saat pancaran sinar sore mulai berubah keemasan, matamu menangkap sosok seniormu, Sabian, yang sedang asyik menawar di gerobak penjual."

# game/week5.rpy:170
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_c6aa039e:

    # p "Sabian? You're out here?"
    p  "Kak Sabian? Lagi di sini juga?"

# game/week5.rpy:172
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_66514c25:

    # sabian "Yo! If it isn't my favorite junior themselves! I thought you were locked in on your work!"
    sabian  "Woi! Wah, ada adik kelasku yang paling rajin nih! Kukira kamu masih nangkring ngendon ngerjain tugas!"

# game/week5.rpy:173
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_70272035:

    # p "I actually managed to escape for once."
    p  "Akhirnya berhasil kabur juga dari meja kerja sesekali, Kak."

# game/week5.rpy:174
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_fcaa9743:

    # sabian "Good! You gotta get out, man. I ran into Trida earlier—that kid's been stressed, right? Needs to eat. You should keep an eye on them—they forget to relax when they're deep in their work."
    sabian  "Mantap! Hidup itu kudu keluar cari angin, Bro. Tadi aku sempat papasan sama Trida tuh—anak itu lagi stres berat kayaknya, kan? Butuh makan banyak tuh. Coba kamu temenin deh—dia sering lupa istirahat kalau udah kelewat fokus nugas."

# game/week5.rpy:175
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_dc018cfd:

    # p "Yeah, they've been a bit overworked."
    p  "Iya nih, dia emang lagi capek banget kayaknya belakangan ini."

# game/week5.rpy:176
translate indonesian week5_cfd_walk_alone_254ef211:

    # sabian "Well, tell them not to overthink their life. Alright, let's get out of here!"
    sabian  "Nah kan, ingetin dia biar nggak overthinking mikirin hidup. Udah ya, aku cabut dulu!"

# game/week5.rpy:191
translate indonesian week5_evening_dinner_1ed94b92:

    # n "The room is dim, lit only by the warm glow of your monitor."
    n  "Ruangan kamarmu temaram, hanya diterangi pendar hangat dari layar monitormu."

# game/week5.rpy:192
translate indonesian week5_evening_dinner_449da8c3:

    # n "You've been staring at a half-finished UV mesh for hours, and your stomach is finally making enough noise to drown out the hum of your PC fan."
    n  "Kamu sudah menatap mesh UV yang belum rampung selama berjam-jam, hingga bunyi keroncongan perutmu akhirnya berhasil mengalahkan suara dengung kipas PC."

# game/week5.rpy:193
translate indonesian week5_evening_dinner_45995a0c:

    # n "You stretch, making your joints pop in the quiet, and decide it's time to head out. You need real food—not another instant noodle cup."
    n  "Kamu meregangkan badan, bunyi gemeretak sendimu memecah keheningan kamar, dan memutuskan sudah saatnya untuk melangkah keluar. Kamu butuh makanan yang beneran bergizi—bukan mi instan cup lagi."

# game/week5.rpy:194
translate indonesian week5_evening_dinner_ce686a87:

    # p "Where should I go for dinner tonight?"
    p  "Makan malam di mana ya enaknya malam ini?"

# game/week5.rpy:210
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_882ec432:

    # n "The door is creaking open, cutting through the low hum of jazz music playing over the speakers."
    n  "Pintu kafe berderit pelan saat didorong terbuka, membelah lantunan musik jaz berirama lembut yang mengalun dari pengeras suara."

# game/week5.rpy:211
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_58e83a28:

    # n "KPK Cafe is a sanctuary of warm atmosphere with a bittersweet scent of espresso."
    n  "Kafe KPK menghadirkan suaka bernuansa hangat dengan semerbak aroma espresso yang manis sekaligus getir."

# game/week5.rpy:212
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_450e7fb8:

    # n "Julia is tucked into a booth near the back. A professional-grade camera lens is resting on the table next to a stack of reference books, and her attention is fixed on a handheld console."
    n  "Julia duduk menyendiri di salah satu bilik meja dekat sudut belakang. Sebuah lensa kamera kelas profesional tergeletak rapi di atas meja di samping tumpukan buku referensi, sementara pandangannya terpusat pada sebuah konsol game genggam."

# game/week5.rpy:213
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_f707de83:

    # n "She's wearing oversized headphones, with a furrowed expression in deep concentration."
    n  "Ia mengenakan headphone berukuran besar, dahinya berkerut menunjukkan konsentrasi yang begitu dalam."

# game/week5.rpy:215
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_8fb6cd99:

    # n "She looks up, quickly pulling one earphone back, and a smile finally blooms."
    n  "Ia mendongak, buru-buru menarik sebelah earphone-nya ke belakang, dan seulas senyuman manis akhirnya merekah di wajahnya."

# game/week5.rpy:217
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_bbbf9033:

    # julia "Oh. Hello. Didn't think I'd see you here tonight."
    julia  "Oh. Halo. Nggak nyangka bakal ketemu kamu di sini malam ini."

# game/week5.rpy:218
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_7428b097:

    # n "She gestures to the empty seat opposite her."
    n  "Ia memberi isyarat ke arah kursi kosong yang berada tepat di hadapannya."

# game/week5.rpy:222
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_6c8245fb:

    # p "What are you doing here?"
    p  "Lagi ngapain di sini?"

# game/week5.rpy:224
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_e91bdda5:

    # p "How are you?"
    p  "Gimana kabarmu?"

# game/week5.rpy:226
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_59efb16e:

    # julia "I'm just... taking a break now. Choosing somewhere not in my room kind of helps me sometimes."
    julia  "Aku cuma... lagi istirahat aja sih. Milih tempat nongkrong di luar kamar biasanya cukup ngebantu buat nenangin diri."

# game/week5.rpy:227
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_da833a11:

    # julia "I was just doing some research for a project. I found this hidden lore bit in a game, and it's honestly fascinating how they handled the environmental storytelling, and I want to look it up."
    julia  "Tadi aku lagi riset sedikit buat materi projek. Aku nemu serpihan cerita tersembunyi di game ini, dan jujur keren banget cara mereka ngejelasin ceritanya lewat detail lingkungan sekitar. Makanya aku pengin telaah lebih dalam."

# game/week5.rpy:228
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_bf966415:

    # n "She pauses, her fingers tightening slightly on the edge of the table."
    n  "Ia terhenti sejenak, jemarinya meremas pelan tepian meja kafe."

# game/week5.rpy:230
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_3ec2ff72:

    # julia "Sorry. I—I didn't mean to info-dump. I just... I get lost in these things. Was that too much?"
    julia  "Maaf ya. A—aku nggak bermaksud ngoceh kepanjangan gini. Soalnya kalau udah ketemu hal kayak gini, aku sering lupa waktu... Apa ceritaku tadi ngebosenin ya?"

# game/week5.rpy:234
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_8c67f030:

    # p "Don't apologize, just tell me. How does storytelling work? I might use it for my project."
    p  "Nggak usah minta maaf, cerita aja. Gimana cara kerja storytelling-nya? Siapa tahu bisa kupakai buat tugasku."

# game/week5.rpy:237
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_8e11d1d3:

    # p "You're fine. I actually enjoy hearing what you're passionate about."
    p  "Nggak apa-apa kok. Aku malah senang dengar hal-hal yang kamu sukai."

# game/week5.rpy:240
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_55fcfbef:

    # p "Save the deep dive until I get food. But we're gonna get into it really."
    p  "Tahan dulu bedah ilmunya sampai makananku datang. Tapi nanti kita bahas tuntas ya."

# game/week5.rpy:243
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_3d77ade8:

    # n "Julia paused before you could see a glimpse of her eyes sparkling in the dim light of the cafe."
    n  "Julia terdiam sejenak sebelum kamu dapat melihat secercah binar kagum terpancar di matanya di bawah temaram lampu kafe."

# game/week5.rpy:245
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_8fc84086:

    # julia "That was—thank you, honestly... I really appreciate that. It's the first time someone really put their attention on this stuff."
    julia  "Itu... makasih banyak ya, beneran... Aku sangat menghargai itu. Baru kali ini ada orang yang beneran mau nyimak hal-hal kayak ginian."

# game/week5.rpy:246
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_f8d5ff2d:

    # p "We are friends, right?"
    p  "Kita kan teman, ya nggak?"

# game/week5.rpy:247
translate indonesian week5_dinner_julia_b3e5eae6:

    # n "Both of you were drowned in that funny tickle in your feet, because a book of friendship journey is opened there."
    n  "Kalian berdua larut dalam kehangatan suasana yang membahagiakan, pertanda lembaran baru kisah persahabatan kalian telah resmi dimulai."

# game/week5.rpy:257
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_ea6f5f49:

    # n "Bazinga is a total sensory overload. The air is thick with the scent of stir-fried garlic and heavy smoke."
    n  "Rumah Makan Bazinga benar-benar menyajikan ledakan sensasi keramaian. Udaranya pekat dengan aroma tumisan bawang putih dan kepulan asap masakan yang sedap."

# game/week5.rpy:258
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_ebfed19e:

    # n "The heavy wooden chairs screech against the concrete, and the wall of chatter is loud enough to drown out the pop music blaring from a corner speaker."
    n  "Kursi-kursi kayu berat berderit nyaring bergesekan dengan lantai semen, dan riuhnya obrolan para pengunjung cukup keras untuk menenggelamkan lagu pop yang berputar di sudut ruangan."

# game/week5.rpy:261
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_0822c7da:

    # trida "YO! OVER HERE! HEY!"
    trida  "WOI! DI SINI! HEI!"

# game/week5.rpy:262
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_c095272c:

    # n "Trida's voice cuts through the noise like a siren. They're grinning and waving both arms like they're signaling a plane."
    n  "Suara lantang Trida membelah kebisingan laksana bunyi sirene. Ia tersenyum lebar sambil melambaikan kedua tangannya ke udara seakan sedang memandu pendaratan pesawat."

# game/week5.rpy:263
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_3de4d1bc:

    # n "Radit, sitting across from them, just drops his head into his hands, totally done with the drama."
    n  "Radit yang duduk tepat di hadapannya hanya bisa membenamkan wajah ke kedua telapak tangan, pasrah menghadapi drama memalukan itu."

# game/week5.rpy:265
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_b0298b34:

    # p "Hey, guys..."
    p  "Halo semuanya..."

# game/week5.rpy:267
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_df3350a6:

    # radit "I swear, one day this guy is gonna get us banned from every place in town."
    radit  "Sumpah ya, lama-lama anak ini bakal bikin kita di-blacklist dari semua tempat makan di kota ini."

# game/week5.rpy:268
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_cf95c29c:

    # trida "Relax! You're just boring. Look, I've got a craving for fried rice tonight. You should start ordering [player_name], I'm seriously starving."
    trida  "Santai napa! Kamunya aja yang kaku. Nih, malam ini aku lagi ngidam nasi goreng banget. Buruan pesen makan, [player_name], aku udah kelaparan parah nih."

# game/week5.rpy:270
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_0e80754a:

    # n "You grab the greasy, laminated menu. The talk shifts to gaming."
    n  "Kamu meraih buku menu berlumur minyak yang telah dilaminasi. Obrolan perlahan beralih membahas seputar dunia game."

# game/week5.rpy:272
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_263ff564:

    # radit "Well, as I said, I finally cleared another run of Final Fantasy VII last night."
    radit  "Ya kayak yang kubilang tadi, semalam aku akhirnya berhasil tamat satu run lagi di Final Fantasy VII."

# game/week5.rpy:273
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_766e358b:

    # trida "Yeah, the lore is actually insane. Honestly, you're right. Why am I killing myself over Maya when I could just live addicted to video games?"
    trida  "Iya gila, lore-nya emang nggak ngotak keren banget. Bener kata kamu sih. Ngapain juga aku nyiksa diri pusing-pusing buka Maya seharian kalau bisa hidup bahagia kecanduan main game?"

# game/week5.rpy:274
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_62097783:

    # radit "You would miss touching grass."
    radit  "Nanti kamu rindu ngerasain rumput di luar."

# game/week5.rpy:275
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_cc5c46a7:

    # trida "But for real, when I'm not glued to a screen, I lowkey miss hiking. Just being out here, you know? No deadlines or anything."
    trida  "Tapi beneran deh, kalau lagi nggak mantengin layar laptop, diam-diam aku kangen juga pengin naik gunung lagi. Nikmatin alam bebas gitu lho, tanpa dikejar deadline tugas sama sekali."

# game/week5.rpy:277
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_4bfed7ac:

    # n "They catch themself, their shoulders slumping as the excitement fades into a sheepish grin."
    n  "Ia tersadar dari lamunannya, pundaknya turun lemas saat antusiasmenya berganti senyuman kikuk yang malu-malu."

# game/week5.rpy:278
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_edf80bcb:

    # trida "My bad, I'm totally yapping again. I just... I needed to not be a hard-working student for five minutes, you know?"
    trida  "Aduh maaf ya, aku malah nyerocos panjang lebar lagi. Aku cuma... lagi butuh rehat lima menit dari tuntutan jadi anak rajin aja sih, hehe."

# game/week5.rpy:282
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_8b8cd3a2:

    # p "Don't sweat it, listening to you rant about games is way better than stress-talking about school."
    p  "Santai aja, dengerin kamu ngoceh soal game jauh lebih asyik daripada pusing ngomongin sekolah."

# game/week5.rpy:285
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_3aaf4c2f:

    # p "Big mood, I'd take a rhythm game high-score over a 3D nightmare any day."
    p  "Relate banget, mending ngejar high score rhythm game daripada mimpi buruk tugas 3D."

# game/week5.rpy:288
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_b622a3b5:

    # p "I thought you were kind of 'outdoorsy,' but I'll let the yapping slide just for tonight."
    p  "Kirain kamu tipe anak alam, tapi khusus malam ini celotehanmu kumaafkan deh."

# game/week5.rpy:291
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_a95344e2:

    # trida "See, Radit? I told you they'd get it. You're just a total buzzkill with your attitude."
    trida  "Tuh kan, Radit! Kubilang juga apa, mereka pasti paham. Kamunya aja yang kerjaannya ngerusak suasana mulu."

# game/week5.rpy:292
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_fcfdeff1:

    # radit "Whatever, man. Just order the food before you start a three-hour essay. I'm starving."
    radit  "Terserah kamu deh, Bro. Buruan pesen makanannya sebelum kamu nulis esai pidato tiga jam. Aku udah laper banget nih."

# game/week5.rpy:294
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_cc945fa6:

    # n "The table feels smaller, more private, despite the surrounding noise."
    n  "Meja makan itu terasa semakin hangat dan intim, terlepas dari hiruk-pikuk suara orang di sekeliling kalian."

# game/week5.rpy:295
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_ab6cc7d3:

    # n "Radit pulls out his phone to check messages, effectively giving you and Trida a pocket of space."
    n  "Radit mengeluarkan ponselnya untuk membalas pesan, sengaja memberi ruang obrolan berdua bagimu dan Trida."

# game/week5.rpy:297
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_63edd989:

    # trida "For real though... thanks for listening earlier. I know I'm a lot. I feel like I've been tired of myself with all this constant pressure to be perfect."
    trida  "Tapi serius deh... makasih banyak ya udah mau dengerin ceritaku tadi. Aku tahu aku ini berisik dan merepotkan. Kadang aku ngerasa muak sendiri sama diriku yang terus ditekan buat serba sempurna."

# game/week5.rpy:298
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_6d210832:

    # trida "I don't really tell anyone else this, but sometimes the stress hits so hard I just sit on my floor in the dark. It's the only way I can force myself to feel something other than crushing panic."
    trida  "Aku nggak pernah cerita ini ke siapa pun, tapi kadang kalau tekanannya udah kelewat batas, aku cuma bisa duduk terdiam di lantai kamar dalam kegelapan. Cuma itu satu-satunya caraku biar nggak tenggelam dalam kepanikan yang menyesakkan."

# game/week5.rpy:299
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_c207f8de:

    # trida "I'm really glad you're the one I ended up sitting with tonight."
    trida  "Aku bener-bener bersyukur banget malam ini bisa duduk bareng kamu."

# game/week5.rpy:303
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_58f45252:

    # n "Some minutes later, the dinner crowd begins to trickle out."
    n  "Beberapa menit kemudian, kerumunan pengunjung makan malam mulai berangsur-angsur pulang."

# game/week5.rpy:304
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_2e803768:

    # trida "Man, I think that's my limit. Hey, let's call it a night. I'm wiped."
    trida  "Wah, kayaknya tenagaku udah mentok nih. Yuk cabut balik. Aku capek banget."

# game/week5.rpy:305
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_af6915f2:

    # radit "Alright, I'm out first. I need to go to the Indoapril. Don't spend the whole walk home making a fuss about your games to [player_name], Trida. See you guys later."
    radit  "Oke, aku cabut duluan ya. Mau mampir ke Indoapril dulu. Trida, awas ya jangan sepanjang jalan pulang kamu gangguin [player_name] pake ocehan gamemu. Sampai ketemu besok ya kalian berdua."

# game/week5.rpy:309
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_8fec4671:

    # n "Radit departs on his bike, leaving the two of you standing on the edge of the dark, quiet street."
    n  "Radit melaju pergi dengan sepedanya, meninggalkan kalian berdua yang berdiri di tepi jalanan malam yang lengang dan sunyi."

# game/week5.rpy:310
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_b11ee133:

    # trida "Hey... are you heading back to the boarding house now? If you don't mind... Could we walk together? I really don't want to walk back alone tonight."
    trida  "Hei... kamu langsung balik ke kosan sekarang? Kalau kamu nggak keberatan... boleh jalan bareng nggak? Malam ini aku bener-bener nggak mau jalan sendirian."

# game/week5.rpy:311
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_dfe5beeb:

    # n "They sound uncharacteristically small. Trida sticks close to your side as you start walking."
    n  "Suaranya terdengar begitu lirih, tak seperti biasanya. Trida berjalan merapat di sampingmu saat langkah kaki kalian mulai berayun."

# game/week5.rpy:312
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_79b673cf:

    # trida "I know it sounds stupid, right? Already this big but still afraid of the dark."
    trida  "Kedengarannya konyol banget kan ya? Udah segede gini tapi masih aja takut sama gelapnya malam."

# game/week5.rpy:313
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_fe517df1:

    # p "Why would you say it like that?"
    p  "Kenapa mikir begitu?"

# game/week5.rpy:314
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_36ccff3e:

    # trida "It's not about the dark... When it's just me, all the thoughts about the animation portfolio, the grades, and the pressure from home? They get so loud. They feel like they're going to swallow me whole."
    trida  "Ini bukan cuma soal gelapnya jalan... Kalau lagi sendirian, semua pikiran soal portofolio animasi, nilai ujian, sampai tuntutan keluarga di rumah... semuanya mendadak berdengung kencang banget di kepala. Rasanya kayak mau nelan aku bulat-bulat."

# game/week5.rpy:318
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_d5e1bb1b:

    # n "They glance at you, a small, sheepish smile tugging at the corners of their mouth."
    n  "Ia melirikmu, seulas senyum kecil yang malu-malu tersungging di sudut bibirnya."

# game/week5.rpy:319
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_1f0ecbc7:

    # trida "Like I said, if I had company or someone to talk to... It's like the noise stops. It's actually quiet in my head for once."
    trida  "Kayak yang kubilang tadi, kalau ada teman di sampingku atau ada orang yang bisa diajak ngobrol... suara-suara bising itu seketika sirna. Akhirnya kepalaku bisa ngerasa tenang."

# game/week5.rpy:320
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_0f949a60:

    # trida "You're kind of like a save point in a game, you know? The place where I can actually catch my breath before the next boss fight."
    trida  "Kamu itu udah kayak save point di dalam game, tahu nggak? Tempat yang bikin aku bisa rehat sejenak menarik napas lega sebelum menghadapi bos fight berikutnya."

# game/week5.rpy:321
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_ea1f9427:

    # n "They stop for a second, looking up at the sky, then back at you with an almost startling intensity."
    n  "Ia berhenti melangkah sesaat, menengadahkan kepala menatap langit malam, lalu kembali menatapmu dengan sorot mata yang begitu dalam dan memikat."

# game/week5.rpy:322
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_845f6910:

    # trida "I'm really, really glad you're the one I'm walking with. It makes the world feel... I don't know, a little less terrifying."
    trida  "Aku bener-bener bersyukur banget orang yang nemenin aku jalan malam ini itu kamu. Dunia rasanya jadi... entahlah, nggak semenakutkan itu lagi."

# game/week5.rpy:323
translate indonesian week5_dinner_trida_507cca5c:

    # n "Their hand brushes against yours as you walk, not quite holding it, but close enough that you can feel the warmth of their skin. They don't pull away."
    n  "Jemarinya menyentuh lembut punggung tanganmu saat kalian berjalan, tidak sepenuhnya menggenggam, namun cukup dekat hingga hangatnya kulit tangannya terasa merambat ke nadimu. Dan ia tidak menarik tangannya menjauh."

# game/week5.rpy:335
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_8110a608:

    # n "Abahciek skips conventional doors; the front is a spacious, open-air gathering spot with elevated wooden platforms and floor mats."
    n  "Warung Makan Abahciek tidak memiliki pintu tertutup konvensional; bagian depannya berupa area lesehan terbuka yang luas dengan panggung beralas kayu dan tikar bersih."

# game/week5.rpy:338
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_6fc7b9bc:

    # chie "[player_name]! No way, are you serious?! Over here!"
    chie  "[player_name]! Nggak salah nih, beneran kamu?! Sini gabung!"

# game/week5.rpy:339
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_969e16a3:

    # n "Chie is halfway out of her seated position on the floor, waving animatedly in the air. Across from her, Sabian leans casually against the wall with an amused smirk."
    n  "Chie setengah bangkit dari duduk lesehannya di lantai, melambaikan tangannya penuh semangat ke udara. Di seberangnya, Sabian bersandar santai ke dinding sambil tersenyum geli melihat tingkah temannya itu."

# game/week5.rpy:340
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_5b36fe32:

    # p "What should I order?"
    p  "Mau pesan apa ya enaknya?"

# game/week5.rpy:344
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_00707352:

    # p "I'll take the Chicken Smackdown."
    p  "Aku pesan Ayam Geprek aja deh."

# game/week5.rpy:346
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_be88f237:

    # p "Chicken Porridge sounds good."
    p  "Bubur Ayam kayaknya sedap nih."

# game/week5.rpy:348
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_842a315e:

    # p "Fried Tofu for me."
    p  "Tahu Goreng buatku."

# game/week5.rpy:352
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_5759d8c4:

    # chie "Anyways, tell me, how's your week actually going? Don't give me the boring version—I want the messy stuff!"
    chie  "Ngomong-ngomong, cerita dong, gimana harimu minggu ini? Jangan cerita yang versi ngebosenin ya—aku mau denger cerita seru dan hebohnya!"

# game/week5.rpy:353
translate indonesian week5_dinner_seniors_cd876258:

    # n "Laughter fills the warm circle around the low table as the three of you enjoy a cheerful, lively dinner."
    n  "Gelak tawa riang mengalun hangat di sekitar meja lesehan rendah saat kalian bertiga menikmati santap malam yang ceria dan penuh kebersamaan."

# game/week5.rpy:369
translate indonesian week5_night_end_39ed7082:

    # n "Back in your room, the quiet hum of the night brings a soothing closure to a long, memorable weekend."
    n  "Kembali ke kamarmu, heningnya desau angin malam menghadirkan penutup yang menenangkan bagi akhir pekan yang panjang dan tak terlupakan ini."

# game/week5.rpy:370
translate indonesian week5_night_end_5506cead:

    # n "You fall asleep with a light heart, looking forward to the school festival ahead."
    n  "Kamu terlelap tidur dengan hati yang ringan dan damai, tak sabar menyambut semaraknya festival sekolah yang menanti di depan mata."

